      "sequence": 380,
      "translation_id": null,
      "translation_id_status": "pending_ast_alignment",
      "source_file": "scenario/001.rpy",
      "source_line": 1715,
      "speaker": "rinka",
      "source_jp": "「わざわざ待ってたの？　入ってくればいいのに。常連さんばっかりだから、みんな気にしないよ」",
      "draft_ko": "“일부러 기다렸어? 그냥 들어오지. 단골손님들뿐이라 다들 신경 안 써.”",
      "source_authority": "Japanese only",
      "english_reference_used": false,
      "status": "first_draft_unreviewed",
      "qa": "deferred_until_full_first_draft"
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "scenario/001.rpy::L1719",
      "sequence": 381,
      "translation_id": null,
      "translation_id_status": "pending_ast_alignment",
      "source_file": "scenario/001.rpy",
      "source_line": 1719,
      "speaker": "miharu",
      "source_jp": "「今日は天気がいいからね。緑を見ながら待つのも気持ちよかったよ」",
      "draft_ko": "“오늘은 날씨가 좋으니까. 녹음을 보며 기다리는 것도 기분 좋았어.”",
      "source_authority": "Japanese only",
      "english_reference_used": false,
      "status": "first_draft_unreviewed",
      "qa": "deferred_until_full_first_draft"
    },
    {
